<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//DITA Bootstrap//DTD DITA Bootstrap Topic//EN" "bootstrap-topic.dtd">
<topic id="color">
  <title>Color</title>
  <shortdesc>Convey meaning through <codeph>color</codeph> with a handful of color utility classes. Includes support for
    styling text and background colors via the semantic <xmlatt>color</xmlatt> attribute.</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Color</indexterm>
        <indexterm>Background</indexterm>
        <indexterm>CSS
          <indexterm><xmlatt>outputclass</xmlatt></indexterm>
        </indexterm>
        <indexterm><xmlatt>color</xmlatt></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <body outputclass="language-markup">
    <section>
      <title>Colors</title>
      <p>Colorize text and backgrounds with color utilities. The <xmlatt
        >color</xmlatt> attribute provides a semantic way to apply standard Bootstrap color themes.</p>
    </section>

    <fig>
      <title>Colors</title>
      <image href="src/color/colors.png" scalefit="yes"/>
    </fig>

    <tabbed-dialog style="pills" margin="t3">
      <section>
        <title>Specialization</title>
        <codeblock><coderef href="code/specialization/color/colors.xml"/></codeblock>
      </section>
      <section>
        <title><xmlatt>outputclass</xmlatt></title>
        <codeblock><coderef href="code/html/color/colors.xml"/></codeblock>
      </section>
    </tabbed-dialog>

    <section>
      <title>Base DITA Elements</title>
      <p
      >Decoration attributes can be applied to many base DITA elements to add background color and contrasting text.</p>
    </section>

    <fig>
      <title>DITA Elements</title>
      <image href="src/color/section-decoration.png" scalefit="yes"/>
    </fig>

    <tabbed-dialog style="pills" margin="t3">
      <section>
        <title>Specialization</title>
        <codeblock><coderef href="code/specialization/color/section-decoration.xml"/></codeblock>
      </section>
      <section>
        <title><xmlatt>outputclass</xmlatt></title>
        <codeblock><coderef href="code/html/color/section-decoration.xml"/></codeblock>
      </section>
    </tabbed-dialog>

    <section>
      <title>Bootstrap Components</title>
      <p>Many specialized components also support the <xmlatt>color</xmlatt> attribute for consistent theming.</p>
    </section>

    <fig>
      <title>Bootstrap Components</title>
      <image href="src/color/specialized-elements.png" scalefit="yes"/>
    </fig>

    <tabbed-dialog style="pills" margin="t3">
      <section>
        <title>Specialization</title>
        <codeblock><coderef href="code/specialization/color/specialized-elements.xml"/></codeblock>
      </section>
      <section>
        <title><xmlatt>outputclass</xmlatt></title>
        <codeblock><coderef href="code/html/color/specialized-elements.xml"/></codeblock>
      </section>
    </tabbed-dialog>

    <section>
      <title>Text Color</title>
      <p>For text-only colorization, the <xmlatt>outputclass</xmlatt> attribute remains the primary method.</p>
    </section>

    <fig>
      <title>Text Color</title>
      <image href="src/color/text-color.png" scalefit="yes"/>
    </fig>

    <codeblock>&lt;p outputclass="text-primary"&gt;.text-primary&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p outputclass="text-secondary"&gt;.text-secondary&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p outputclass="text-success"&gt;.text-success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p outputclass="text-danger"&gt;.text-danger&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p outputclass="text-warning bg-dark"&gt;.text-warning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p outputclass="text-info bg-dark"&gt;.text-info&lt;/p&gt;</codeblock>
  </body>
</topic>
